# GX

This repo uses GX (`.gx/` present). Do not use `git commit` or `git push` for normal work.

- Finish work: `gx add -m "…"`
- Publish: `gx pr`
- Inspect: `git status`, `git diff`, `git log` only

Read the gx skill before any commit, push, or PR.
